BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (not clear a recall, transfer a software license, or release a device. Use an explicit unresolved flag that blocks) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (the affected decision while allowing unrelated research to continue. Each step should have an exit condition:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (reject the lead, request a specific document, or advance with named evidence. The desk gains more from) Tj ET
