BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (Schedule collectors as small independent jobs rather than one fragile overnight script. Python urllib.request,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (json, sqlite3, hashlib, and logging can support an initial implementation without a sprawling integration stack.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (Store credentials outside source code, restrict each token to its required function, and redact authorization) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (headers from logs. Use request timeouts, bounded retries, incremental checkpoints, and idempotent writes) Tj ET
